            "notes": "As far as Powers go, go for anything that gives you more orbs. It doesn't matter too much what order you choose, I like to mix it up sometimes. I mostly go for  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560)  first because it's good for stat farming which in turn gives you more cash.\n\nObviously we're going for  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  for AP. You'll build ult fast, so  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)  is really good for even more AP.  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  is optional and you can replace it with Survival items such as  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)  or  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) . I personally go with the WP because you'll be using Biotic Grasp a lot anyway.",
