            "notes": "For Round 2, don't sell anything unless you need more cash to by the blues. The two blues we need are  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)  and C [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) . If you need to sell any greens, sell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  and/or  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) .\n\nN [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)  is extremely important to this build and you'll keep it the entire game since it has one of the highest AP percentages available.",
