            "notes": "I LOVE  [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb)  for this build. Don't fade into team fights. Save fade for ESCAPING team fights, and preferably use damage orbs when doing that since you'll be likely leaving an orb by whoever you were fighting. A healing orb is useless in the enemy's backlines if you're not even there anymore. Healing orbs with this Power work best for stalling points.\n\nAgain, min-max AP. If you can't afford  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce)  without sacrificing some ability power, don't go for it.",
